' --- manual: everything below this line is hand-authored; the script preserves it ---

' One unit per entity, and one hand-written aggregator that lists them. The
' units include the dq protocol headers and reach the service over the bus, so
' the part links the api library and not the core.

class ores::shell::app::commands::dq_commands #ECECEC {
    {static} +register_commands(root_menu : Menu, session : nats_client) : void
}
note right of "ores::shell::app::commands::dq_commands"
The hand-written list of units. No facet emits it, so it is the
one file in the part that a regeneration never writes.
end note

